More on genotyping code of qtl_cartographer data for BC or RILs:

I found out that it depends on the previous cross type present in the
QTLcartographer file. For example, if the original cross type in
QTLcartographer was RI1, then R/qtl will correctly select the A and B
genotypes. So, it seems that what I described before will only happen
when the type of cross is changed after importing.

